OL,3,AApple Maps renames Lake Ontario as Lake
OL,4,AAmerica after Trump order
OL,5,
OL,6,FApple has renamed Lake Ontario as Lake
OL,7,FAmerica on its Maps app, after an order
OL,8,Ffrom US President Donald Trump as part
OL,9,Fof Washington's trade spat with Canada.
OL,11,FThe change was made for US-based users,
OL,12,Fwhile those in Canada will continue to
OL,13,Fsee Lake Ontario displayed. The BBC has
OL,14,Fcontacted Apple for comment.
OL,16,FThe iPhone maker's move follows Trump's
OL,17,Fexecutive order to change the lake's
OL,18,Fname after trade talks between the
OL,19,Fneighbouring countries collapsed late
OL,20,Flast month, with Washington imposing
OL,21,Fnew 50% tariffs on $20bn (#14.8bn;
OL,22,FC$28bn) worth of Canadian goods.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
