OL,3,AApple Maps renames Lake Ontario as Lake
OL,4,AAmerica after Trump order
OL,5,
OL,6,FRival technology giant Google made a
OL,7,Fsimilar switch for its users in the US
OL,8,Fin recent days, leading to backlash on
OL,9,Fsocial media.
